OL,3,ALidl banned from selling copycat
OL,4,ABirkenstock sandals, Dutch court rules
OL,5,
OL,6,FLidl must stop selling copycat versions
OL,7,Fof Birkenstock's famous sandals in the
OL,8,FNetherlands, a Dutch court has ruled.
OL,10,FThe discount supermarket chain faces a
OL,11,Ffine of bB,5,000 (#4,200) per day if it
OL,12,Ffails to comply and must also hand over
OL,13,Fsales data to Birkenstock, according to
OL,14,Fthe ruling.
OL,16,FLidl must also compensate Birkenstock
OL,17,Fand pay its legal fees, with the amount
OL,18,Fto be decided in separate court
OL,19,Fdecisions.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
