OL,3,ALidl banned from selling copycat
OL,4,ABirkenstock sandals, Dutch court rules
OL,5,
OL,6,FBirkenstock said the judgement sent a
OL,7,Fclear message that "copycats must not
OL,8,Fbe allowed to free-ride on [our]
OL,9,Fcreativity and innovation". The BBC has
OL,10,Fcontacted Lidl for comment.
